{"shortDescription":"ATLANTA, Sept. 10, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Invesco Ltd. (NYSE:IVZ)1, a leading global asset management firm announced today preliminary month-end assets under management (AUM) of $2,562.1 billion, an increase of 4.7% versus previous month-end. The firm delivered net long-term inflows of $27.6 billion…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ATLANTA, Sept. 10, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Invesco Ltd. (",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"NYSE:IVZ","text":"NYSE:IVZ"}},")1, a leading global asset management firm announced today preliminary month-end assets under management (AUM) of $2,562.1 billion, an increase of 4.7% versus previous month-end. The firm delivered net long-term inflows of $27.6 billion in the month. Money market net inflows were $35.8 billion. AUM was positively impacted by favorable market returns which increased AUM by $49 billion. FX increased AUM by $2.7 billion. Preliminary average total AUM for the quarter through August 31 was $2,492.2 billion, and preliminary average active AUM for the quarter through August 31 was $1,236.6 billion."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":10,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Total Assets Under Management"]}]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["(in billions)"]}]},{"type":"ta